      "scenario": "kick.json",
      "topologies": ["RR", "RR-aa", "RO"],
      "note": "A listen host types SERVER PUNT ALL. Its console line goes to its own server as C2S 0x04 (Client_ProcessConsoleCommand @0x520EFE..0x520F29), which runs NETLOG and STAT only and echoes the line to its sender as S2C 0x06 (NapiNPServerMsg_HandleConsoleLine @0x5199D0, the send @0x519AC5). The echo runs the line as a client command (NapiNPClientMsg_HandleConsoleEcho @0x432BC0, the call @0x432C12), whose SERVER verb (NapiClientCmd_HandleDebugCommand @0x42C4D0, the arm @0x42C85D, the match @0x42C867) queues the rest as C2S 0x24 with no gate (@0x42C904..0x42C922). NapiNPServerMsg_0x024 @0x514DC0 hands it to Server_HandleBanPuntCommand with the sender's slot (@0x514DE7), authorized as a local slot (+5, @0x50B3C4); PUNT ALL disconnects every non-local player, reason 33 S.C:SPA (@0x50B951). OR and OO wait for the runners to wire the OpenNova host's typed cells (scenario_play types char steps as keystrokes)."
    },
